2Ti 4:1 , He exhorts him to do his duty with all care and diligence;
2Ti 4:6 , certifies him of the nearness of his death;
2Ti 4:9 , wills him to come speedily unto him, and to bring Marcus with him, and certain things which he wrote for;
2Ti 4:14 , warns him to beware of Alexander the smith;
2Ti 4:16 , informs him what had befallen him at his first answering;
2Ti 4:19 , and soon after he concludes.
